You seem to have drunk too much at the club earlier, so after many hours of wandering, you stumble upon Shrek's Swamp. Of course, you sober up the instant you touch the foul mud, but after lots of wading around, you realize that it is an infinitely looping swamp with no way out. 


A sign nearby reads:

 ___________________________________________
|                                           |
|   He who was drunk in the mud did sunk    |
|	And realized the only way out           |
|	Was to impale Shrek, all throughout     |
|                                           |
|	From his right pocket of shrunk         |
|	'Pulled out a crossbow-                 |
|	Arrows, nice and hollow                 |
|                                           |
|	From his left pocket of skunk           |
|	'Took out hydrochloric acid-            |
|	Topping both arrows like salad          |
|                                           |
|	Alas, he was ready to begin his quest;  |
|	Through Shrek's ear, he decided         |
|	His arrow would finesse.                |
|___________________________________________|
					|   |
					|   |
					|   |	
					|   |
					|   |
					|   |
					|   |	
					|   |
					|   |
					|   |
					|___|

Checking your pockets, you indeed find a crossbow and some hydrochloric acid. Now, as you make your way towards impending doom, you see two more signs. 


The first one says:

 ________________________________________________
|                                                |
|             BEWARE THE TENTACLES!              |
|                                                |
|    After feeling for your legs once, they      |
|  suck you down and pull you to another spot!   |
|                                                |
|________________________________________________|
